      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "這項合作旨在提升臺灣在晶片技術的領先地位。",
      "start_sec": 80.603,
      "end_sec": 85.613,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/bcbf1b67db222252873db0ae03840470c24f3f28426939b0f992834ab13dd34f.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "It makes the nation's position in the global supply chain stronger.",
      "start_sec": 86.213,
      "end_sec": 91.153,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/6b227db8466b83356c4719a712928036287e446b9ef0bb3c7801595b8eda813c.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s04"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "這鞏固了臺灣在全球供應鏈中的地位。",
      "start_sec": 91.953,
      "end_sec": 96.244,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/b75a0d8c74565442aa6e717e7e4fa6e082bd2f68005725eaf4ca7a6b4dda065c.wav",
